  _lines:
  - 'Haruka: Good morning Akito. How are you today?'
  - "Akito: I\u2019m fine. Could be better though. I\u2019ve just been stressed out
    with exams coming up."
  - "Haruka: That must be really tough. But I understand though. I\u2019ve been busy
    preparing for exams too."
  - 'Haruka: I heard it was your birthday today, I hope you have a nice day today.'
  - 'Akito: Wow thanks for remembering.'
  - '*You reach inside your bag'
  - "\"Omg where is my gift for Akio?! The teddy bear! It\u2019s gone!\""
  - 'Akito: Hey are you looking for something?'
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - It's nothing...
  - Just checking if I have my books.
